# ON THIS DAY #

[LINK: (January 31) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/January_31] :  [LINK: (Independence Day) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nauru_Independence_Act_1967]  in  [LINK: (Nauru) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Nauru]  ( [LINK: (1968) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1968] )

[LINK: (1578) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1578]  –  [LINK: (Eighty Years' War) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Eighty_Years%27_War] : Spanish forces won a crushing victory at the  [LINK: (Battle of Gembloux) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Battle_of_Gembloux_(1578)] , threatening the  [LINK: (States General of the Netherlands) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/States_General_of_the_Netherlands]  and contributing to its move from  [LINK: (Brussels) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brussels]  to  [LINK: (Antwerp) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antwerp] .

[LINK: (1747) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1747]  – The  [LINK: (London Lock Hospital) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/London_Lock_Hospital] , the first  [LINK: (voluntary hospital) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Voluntary_hospital]  specialising in the treatment of  [LINK: (venereal diseases) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sexually_transmitted_infection] , opened.

[LINK: (1961) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1961]  – Aboard  [LINK: (NASA) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/NASA] 's  [LINK: (Mercury-Redstone 2) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mercury-Redstone_2] , the chimpanzee  [LINK: (Ham) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ham_(chimpanzee)]  became the first  [LINK: (hominid) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Hominidae]  to be launched into outer space.

[LINK: (1988) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/1988]  –  [LINK: (Doug Williams) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Doug_Williams_(quarterback)]  became the first African-American quarterback to play in the  [LINK: (Super Bowl) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Super_Bowl] , leading the  [LINK: (Washington Redskins) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Washington_Commanders]  to victory in  [LINK: (Super Bowl XXII) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Super_Bowl_XXII] .

[LINK: (2013) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/2013]  – A gas leak underneath the  [LINK: (Pemex Executive Tower) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Torre_Ejecutiva_Pemex]  in  [LINK: (Mexico City) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Mexico_City]   [LINK: (caused an explosion) -> https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Torre_Ejecutiva_Pemex_explosion]  (aftermath pictured) that killed at least 37 people and injured another 121.

